sequenceDiagram
    participant Op as Operator
    participant Ctl as ChangeController<br/>(TenantGuard)
    participant Svc as ChangeSetService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant St as CurrentState
    participant Hub as PushHub
    participant Cl as ConfigClient
    participant Bk as Booking code

    Op->>Ctl: POST /tenants/acme/changes {SET booking.cutoff=PT30M @ OFFICE blr}
    Ctl->>Ctl: token role + tenant match
    Ctl->>Svc: submit(changeSet, CHANGE, idempotencyKey)
    Svc->>Svc: writeLock.lock()
    Svc->>Svc: ChangeSetValidator(current).validate → 422 on error
    Svc->>DB: BEGIN, INSERT config_change RETURNING version
    Note over DB: version 144 is assigned here
    Svc->>DB: UPSERT config_override, COMMIT
    Svc->>St: apply(144, changeSet) → new Snapshot, AtomicReference.set
    Svc->>Hub: publish(event 144)   (only after commit)
    Svc->>Svc: writeLock.unlock()
    Svc-->>Ctl: 144
    Ctl-->>Op: 201 {version: 144}

    Hub-->>Cl: SSE  id: 144  data: {event}
    Cl->>Cl: 144 == local+1 → snapshot.apply(event)
    Note over Cl: readers switch here: one AtomicReference.set
    Cl->>Cl: store.save (tmp file + atomic move)
    Cl-->>Bk: listener: config updated version=144
    Bk->>Cl: snapshot().get("booking.cutoff", OFFICE blr)
    Cl-->>Bk: PT30M (source OFFICE, version 144)
